# Zig's io_uring_setup syscall and libxev's IORING_OP_CLOSE bypass TSan's
# libc FD interceptors. When a ring reuses a closed socket's descriptor,
# its intercepted mmap64 can race with stale socket-creation metadata.
# Suppress only reports containing the ring's submission-queue mapping
# initialization, not socket operations or application lifecycle code.
race:os.linux.IoUring.SubmissionQueue.init
